{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Pwb6Y5X7GryCNvphhQead6","type":"tool_result","content":"529\t          5. When scope discovery yields no files, emit [] for both arrays; the upsert script\n530\t             returns a warning and review continues with an empty graph.\n531\t        bash: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/upsert.cjs --spec-folder \\\"{spec_folder}\\\" --loop-type \\\"review\\\" --session-id \\\"{config.sessionId}\\\" --nodes '{coverage_seed_nodes_json}' --edges '{coverage_seed_edges_json}' --seed-source \\\"{coverage_seed_source}\\\" --seed-confidence \\\"{coverage_seed_confidence}\\\"\"\n532\t        outputs:\n533\t          - coverage_seed_nodes_json: \"Seed nodes for review SLICE and FILE kinds only\"\n534\t          - coverage_seed_edges_json: \"Seed COVERS edges where review target groupings resolved\"\n535\t          - coverage_seed_warning: \"Warning emitted when the seed batch inserts zero nodes, else empty\"\n536\t        on_warning:\n537\t          log: \"Coverage graph seed inserted zero nodes; continuing with an empty graph.\"\n538\t          proceed: true\n539\t\n540\t      step_enrich_strategy_context:\n541\t        action: \"Ensure Known Context is written only after strategy.md exists\"\n542\t        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n543\t        condition: \"prior_context_found\"\n544\t        edit: \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n545\t        note: \"Append or replace the Known Context section with prior_context_summary and retained detail from prior_context\"\n546\t\n547\t      step_enrich_strategy_resource_map:\n548\t        action: \"Inject resource-map status into Known Context after strategy.md exists\"\n549\t        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n550\t        edit: \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n551\t        note: \"When resource_map_present is true, append the resource_map_known_context snapshot and add Resource Map Coverage to the Review Charter. When false, append 'resource-map.md not present; skipping coverage gate'.\"\n552\t\n553\t      step_frontier_reduce_seed:\n554\t        action: \"Reduce once after the seed so iteration 1 already reviews a frontier node\"\n555\t        enabled_when: \"depth_mode == 'expansive'\"\n556\t        dry_run_boundary: \"reducer-refresh\"\n557\t        note: \"The loop binds active_frontier_node and the frontier dimension from registry.frontier, and step_create_findings_registry writes a registry with no frontier after the seed has run. Only the reducer projects the seeded nodes into it. Without this pass the first iteration has no frontier node and no frontier block. A fan-out lineage runs it too: its reducer_artifact_arg points the reducer at the lineage's own directory, where fanout-run.cjs put its share of the nodes.\"\n558\t        command: |\n559\t          node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\n560\t        working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n561\t        on_failure: \"Log the stderr line as a config_warning bookkeeping event and continue; iteration 1 then runs on the strategy's own dimension queue and step_reduce_review_state picks the frontier up after it.\"\n562\t\n563\t      step_init_complete:\n564\t        log: \"Initialization complete. Config, state, and strategy files created. Review scope: {review_scope_files_count} files, {dimension_queue_count} dimensions.\"\n565\t        set: { current_iteration: 1, p0_count: 0, p1_count: 0, p2_count: 0 }\n566\t\n567\t      # ─── APPROVAL GATE: Post-Init ───\n568\t      gate_init_approval:\n569\t        applies_to: confirm\n570\t        type: approval_gate\n571\t        purpose: \"Show review scope, dimensions, and target files. Get approval to start loop.\"\n572\t        present: |\n573\t          ## Review Initialization Complete\n574\t\n575\t          **Review Target**: {review_target} ({review_target_type})\n576\t          **Scope**: {review_scope_files_count} files\n577\t          **Dimensions**: {dimension_queue}\n578\t          **Max Iterations**: {max_iterations}\n579\t          **Convergence Threshold**: {convergence_threshold}\n580\t          **Known Context Summary**: {prior_context_summary}\n581\t\n582\t          **Files in scope:**\n583\t          {review_scope_files_summary}\n584\t\n585\t          Review `{state_paths.strategy}` for the full scope and dimension ordering.\n586\t          **State files located in**: {state_paths.packet_dir}/\n587\t\n588\t          Options:\n589\t          A) Start review loop\n590\t          B) Adjust scope or dimensions\n591\t          C) Cancel\n592\t        wait_for: \"User response\"\n593\t        after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n594\t        on_A: { set: { current_iteration: 1, p0_count: 0, p1_count: 0, p2_count: 0 }, proceed_to: phase_loop }\n595\t        on_B: { action: \"Apply user adjustments to strategy.md, scope, or dimensions\", return_to: gate_init_approval }\n596\t        on_C: { action: \"Cancel workflow\", status: \"CANCELLED\", release_lock: step_release_lock }\n597\t\n598\t  # ════════\n599\t  # PHASE 2: ITERATION LOOP\n600\t  # ════════\n601\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:45:04.737Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/.claude-account2/projects/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/18d19bb5-f780-4919-a6a4-072b2594a117/tool-results/b2bhpdn82.txt","content":"          5. When scope discovery yields no files, emit [] for both arrays; the upsert script\n             returns a warning and review continues with an empty graph.\n        bash: \"node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/upsert.cjs --spec-folder \\\"{spec_folder}\\\" --loop-type \\\"review\\\" --session-id \\\"{config.sessionId}\\\" --nodes '{coverage_seed_nodes_json}' --edges '{coverage_seed_edges_json}' --seed-source \\\"{coverage_seed_source}\\\" --seed-confidence \\\"{coverage_seed_confidence}\\\"\"\n        outputs:\n          - coverage_seed_nodes_json: \"Seed nodes for review SLICE and FILE kinds only\"\n          - coverage_seed_edges_json: \"Seed COVERS edges where review target groupings resolved\"\n          - coverage_seed_warning: \"Warning emitted when the seed batch inserts zero nodes, else empty\"\n        on_warning:\n          log: \"Coverage graph seed inserted zero nodes; continuing with an empty graph.\"\n          proceed: true\n\n      step_enrich_strategy_context:\n        action: \"Ensure Known Context is written only after strategy.md exists\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n        condition: \"prior_context_found\"\n        edit: \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n        note: \"Append or replace the Known Context section with prior_context_summary and retained detail from prior_context\"\n\n      step_enrich_strategy_resource_map:\n        action: \"Inject resource-map status into Known Context after strategy.md exists\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"state-mutation\"\n        edit: \"{state_paths.strategy}\"\n        note: \"When resource_map_present is true, append the resource_map_known_context snapshot and add Resource Map Coverage to the Review Charter. When false, append 'resource-map.md not present; skipping coverage gate'.\"\n\n      step_frontier_reduce_seed:\n        action: \"Reduce once after the seed so iteration 1 already reviews a frontier node\"\n        enabled_when: \"depth_mode == 'expansive'\"\n        dry_run_boundary: \"reducer-refresh\"\n        note: \"The loop binds active_frontier_node and the frontier dimension from registry.frontier, and step_create_findings_registry writes a registry with no frontier after the seed has run. Only the reducer projects the seeded nodes into it. Without this pass the first iteration has no frontier node and no frontier block. A fan-out lineage runs it too: its reducer_artifact_arg points the reducer at the lineage's own directory, where fanout-run.cjs put its share of the nodes.\"\n        command: |\n          node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/reduce-state.cjs {spec_folder} {reducer_artifact_arg} --create-missing-anchors\n        working_directory: \"{repo_root}\"\n        on_failure: \"Log the stderr line as a config_warning bookkeeping event and continue; iteration 1 then runs on the strategy's own dimension queue and step_reduce_review_state picks the frontier up after it.\"\n\n      step_init_complete:\n        log: \"Initialization complete. Config, state, and strategy files created. Review scope: {review_scope_files_count} files, {dimension_queue_count} dimensions.\"\n        set: { current_iteration: 1, p0_count: 0, p1_count: 0, p2_count: 0 }\n\n      # ─── APPROVAL GATE: Post-Init ───\n      gate_init_approval:\n        applies_to: confirm\n        type: approval_gate\n        purpose: \"Show review scope, dimensions, and target files. Get approval to start loop.\"\n        present: |\n          ## Review Initialization Complete\n\n          **Review Target**: {review_target} ({review_target_type})\n          **Scope**: {review_scope_files_count} files\n          **Dimensions**: {dimension_queue}\n          **Max Iterations**: {max_iterations}\n          **Convergence Threshold**: {convergence_threshold}\n          **Known Context Summary**: {prior_context_summary}\n\n          **Files in scope:**\n          {review_scope_files_summary}\n\n          Review `{state_paths.strategy}` for the full scope and dimension ordering.\n          **State files located in**: {state_paths.packet_dir}/\n\n          Options:\n          A) Start review loop\n          B) Adjust scope or dimensions\n          C) Cancel\n        wait_for: \"User response\"\n        after_gate_refresh_lock: gate_defaults.after_gate_refresh_lock\n        on_A: { set: { current_iteration: 1, p0_count: 0, p1_count: 0, p2_count: 0 }, proceed_to: phase_loop }\n        on_B: { action: \"Apply user adjustments to strategy.md, scope, or dimensions\", return_to: gate_init_approval }\n        on_C: { action: \"Cancel workflow\", status: \"CANCELLED\", release_lock: step_release_lock }\n\n  # ════════\n  # PHASE 2: ITERATION LOOP\n  # ════════\n","numLines":73,"startLine":529,"totalLines":601}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Pwb6Y5X7GryCNvphhQead6","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
