js, git writes).\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n- All four dimensions covered and newFindingsRatio under 0.10 for the rolling window, or maxIterations 7.\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 1\n- P2 (Suggestions): 2\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 9. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n### Stale mcp-tooling/mcp-*-devtools paths under .skilled: none. -- BLOCKED (iteration 1, 1 attempts)\n- What was tried: Stale mcp-tooling/mcp-*-devtools paths under .skilled: none.\n- Why blocked: Repeated iteration evidence ruled this direction out.\n- Do NOT retry: Stale mcp-tooling/mcp-*-devtools paths under .skilled: none.\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:exhausted-approaches -->\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 11. NEXT FOCUS\n- Dimension: security. Focus: Bladebro and Aside safety rules (R-SEC-1/2/3), teardown and install scripts, own-Chrome attach lift in the advisor (013), against their goals. Rotation: correctness done. Required evidence: file:line in scripts and SKILL.md. Review verdict: CONDITIONAL\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:next-focus -->\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n- resource-map.md not present; skipping coverage gate.\n- Prior generation (2026-11-21): P1=4, P2=17; three P1 fixed, R1-P1-001 downgraded to P2 and left (review-archive/20261124T044326Z-restart/review-report.md:147-152).\n- Scope: 470 files pre-bound (review-scope-files.txt); 277 under .skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":43,"oldLines":8,"newStart":43,"newLines":10,"lines":[" ",