    ok \"browser-debugger-cli@alpha: resolvable via npx --no-install\"\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/doctor.sh:66:    warn \"bdg not on PATH and browser-debugger-cli@alpha not resolvable via npx --no-install\"\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/scripts/doctor.sh:69:  warn \"bdg not on PATH and npx not found\"\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/scripts/install.sh:2:# WHY: operator-invoked wrapper around the official Aside curl installer.\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/scripts/install.sh:31:    3. Runs the official installer: curl -fsSL <url> | bash\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/scripts/install.sh:74:command -v curl >/dev/null 2>&1 || { err \"curl not found — required to fetch the installer\"; exit 1; }\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/scripts/install.sh:77:info \"curl -fsSL $INSTALLER_URL | bash\"\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-aside-devtools/scripts/install.sh:78:if curl -fsSL \"$INSTALLER_URL\" | bash; then\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/mcp-servers/bdg-cli/README.md:24:| **Invoke with** | `npm install -g browser-debugger-cli@alpha`, then `bdg --version` and `bdg <url>`. |\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/mcp-servers/bdg-cli/README.md:43:npm install -g browser-debugger-cli@alpha\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/mcp-servers/bdg-cli/README.md:73:| `command not found: bdg` | Not installed or npm bin not on `PATH` | `npm install -g browser-debugger-cli@alpha`; check `npm config get prefix` and add its `bin` to `PATH` |\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-chrome-devtools/mcp-servers/chrome-devtools-mcp/README.md:25:| **Works on** | `npx chrome-devtools-mcp` over stdio, launched by Code Mode on demand: with `--isolated=true` for the two isolated manuals, and with `--autoConnect` for the live one. |\n.skilled/skills/mcp-browser-use/mcp-bladebro/mcp-servers/bladebro-cli/README.md