{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014cRS87HvAtyz798jPDu7gA","type":"tool_result","content":"3:        fanout_graph_store: 'When config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID is set, this run is a fan-out lineage and its coverage graph store is {artifact_dir}/graph-db, inside the lineage write surface. The fan-out runner exports DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR to that directory. Run this step against it and never skip it as a write outside the lineage; when DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR is absent from the environment, prefix the command with DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR=\"{artifact_dir}/graph-db\".'\n13:        bash: 'node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs --spec-folder \"{spec_folder}\" --loop-type \"review\" --session-id \"{session_id}\" --convergence-mode \"{convergence_mode}\" --depth-mode \"{depth_mode}\" --stop-decision --config-path \"{state_paths.config}\" --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" --registry-path \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" --iteration-count \"{iteration_count}\" --security-sensitive-fix-scope \"{security_sensitive_fix_scope}\" --fix-replay-required-rows \"{fix_completeness_replay_required_rows}\" --fix-replay-passing-rows \"{fix_completeness_replay_passing_rows}\" --iteration \"{current_iteration}\" {convergence_write_arg}'\n54:          4. a STOP candidate exists when every dimension is clean (all_dimensions_clean) or the weighted vote passes (composite_converged). The vote cutoffs follow the configured convergenceThreshold. When neither forms and depth_mode == \"expansive\", a run whose frontier holds at least one answered node and none still open or active forms a hard candidate (frontier_drained); a frontier closed with nothing answered forms none. A default run never forms it, and the legal-stop gates below still decide it.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<redacted>","uuid":"<redacted>","timestamp":"2026-11-24T04:52:26.361Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"3:        fanout_graph_store: 'When config.fanout_lineage_artifact_dir is bound, or SPECKIT_FANOUT_LINEAGE_ID is set, this run is a fan-out lineage and its coverage graph store is {artifact_dir}/graph-db, inside the lineage write surface. The fan-out runner exports DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR to that directory. Run this step against it and never skip it as a write outside the lineage; when DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR is absent from the environment, prefix the command with DEEP_LOOP_COVERAGE_DB_DIR=\"{artifact_dir}/graph-db\".'\n13:        bash: 'node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/convergence.cjs --spec-folder \"{spec_folder}\" --loop-type \"review\" --session-id \"{session_id}\" --convergence-mode \"{convergence_mode}\" --depth-mode \"{depth_mode}\" --stop-decision --config-path \"{state_paths.config}\" --state-log \"{state_paths.state_log}\" --registry-path \"{state_paths.findings_registry}\" --iteration-count \"{iteration_count}\" --security-sensitive-fix-scope \"{security_sensitive_fix_scope}\" --fix-replay-required-rows \"{fix_completeness_replay_required_rows}\" --fix-replay-passing-rows \"{fix_completeness_replay_passing_rows}\" --iteration \"{current_iteration}\" {convergence_write_arg}'\n54:          4. a STOP candidate exists when every dimension is clean (all_dimensions_clean) or the weighted vote passes (composite_converged). The vote cutoffs follow the configured convergenceThreshold. When neither forms and depth_mode == \"expansive\", a run whose frontier holds at least one answered node and none still open or active forms a hard candidate (frontier_drained); a frontier closed with nothing answered forms none. A default run never forms it, and the legal-stop gates below still decide it.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[],"moreFiles":0,"unavailable":true}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_014cRS87HvAtyz798jPDu7gA","permission_decision":{"d